        "action_date": "2025-07-23",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><b>Urban Indian Health Parity Act</b></p> <p>This bill&nbsp;applies a&nbsp;Federal Medical Assistance Percentage (i.e., the federal matching rate under Medicaid) of 100% with respect to amounts expended as medical assistance for services received through an Urban Indian organization&nbsp;under a grant or contract with the Indian Health Service.</p>",
        "update_date": "2025-12-02T16:39:37Z"
      }
